de Prova. 1 Termopar tipo K. Dimensões (C x L x A): 4.70 x 7.10 x 13.30 centímetros Peso: 0.19 Kg', 203.5, 160.9, NULL, 'Home & Living > Tools & Home Improvement > Tools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825bd-mr1cs5d5h79cc6', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F489001115%2F58256813430', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
