Calçados!', 189.99, 118.99, NULL, 'Women Shoes > Heels', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-82599-mgffyr1fqbk9db', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F448506781%2F22094673895', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
