nches, Chairs & Stools', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81zu7-ml50904vypdyf4', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F791969908%2F48556456679', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
